DTSTART:20260217T030000Z
DTEND:20260217T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20260217T030000Z
UID:pNHaU63YYO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 123 mins (2h03m)\n\nJulianne Moore gives an astonish
 ing performance as Carol White\, a suburban housewife whose affluent envir
 onment suddenly turns against her.  A bold\, darkly comic\, completely or
 iginal drama\, depicting Carol's descent into the horrors of modern-day li
 ving from acclaimed filmmaker Todd Haynes (Poison\, Superstar). New 4K re
 storation.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/safe\n\nEstimated st
 art: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Cutoff
DTSTART:20260321T200000Z
DTEND:20260321T214500Z
DTSTAMP:20260321T200000Z
UID:2iLF6Smtpd
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nPresented by Aravaipa Running Th
 e Cutoff is a feature-length documentary set inside Cocodona 250\, a 250 m
 ile ultramarathon across Arizona. This time Dylan Harris followed the unde
 rdogs\, the back of the pack runners who are barely making cutoffs. Who wi
 ll make it and who won't.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-c
 utoff-presented-by-aravaipa-running\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
